# An allowlist keeps Git, credentials, tests, caches and local runtime data out of the image.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic.ini
!src/
!src/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!scripts/
!scripts/evolution_status.py
!scripts/prepare_speech.py
!docker/
!docker/vasa.Dockerfile
!.local/
!.local/evolution-source/
!.local/evolution-source/vasa-host-trust.pem
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
